          "speaker": "B",
          "text": "いいえ、先生は来ません。",
          "translation": "No, the teacher won’t come."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Who will come to school tomorrow?",
      "choices": [
        "Only the teacher",
        "Both B and the teacher",
        "B, but not the teacher",
        "Neither B nor the teacher"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "B says 来ます (will come), but 先生は来ません (the teacher won’t come). Listen for the negative ending ません."
    },
